            "desc": "Every filled slot of each pool's `stakers` box, pools in order and slots in box order. A pool that doesn't exist\n(or didn't yet), or has no `stakers` box, logs nothing. Four full pools (200 stakers each, 80 bytes a slot) fill one\ncall's 64 KB of logs. `@ghostkit-chunk pools refsPerItem=1 maxPerTxn=4`",
