    ],
    "desc": "RetiQueryReader: the reads only a dtalgorand node's read-only queries (`POST /v2/query`) can make. Queries may read any\napp's boxes (AVM 13's `app_box_*` opcodes, as if every app had set `ForeignBoxReads`), which simulate refuses, so this\nreader never simulates: on a node without queries the SDK reads the same state another way.",
